        {
          "extraction_class": "individual_presentation",
          "extraction_text": "cranial nerves intact and symmetrical; reflexes +2 and equal bilaterally; normal tone and strength in all extremities; sensation normal for pain and light touch; straight leg test negative bilaterally; moderate to severe paraspinal spasm; mild-moderate hyperlordosis during spasms; opisthotonic and rigid during spasms; abdominal musculature board-like to palpation; remained alert and cried out in pain",
