        },
        {
          "extraction_class": "individual_diagnostics",
          "extraction_text": "Initial laboratory data showed mild anemia and serum bicarbonate of 15 mmoVL; electrolytes, WBCs, urinalysis, creatine kinase, and calcium within normal limits",
